# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card, button and
# chord change is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full)
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Story page: Tempo 86, Structure 70, Tension 0, Wander 1:29. Piece Pre-show, D minor
# (the rings follow, queued: the chord, how far to the next, the scale from the root up)
listen
where
said Scale D, E, F, G, A, B, C
# a page settles before it is said
tap GLO
turn SELECT -5
wait 300
said Pad page: Level 50, Swell 45, Sound Rhodes, Bright 45
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root D, Tempo 86, Sleep Off, Fade 5s
# the sleep timer: a quarter hour
spin K3 1
wait 300
said SLEEP TIMER ON
spin K3 -1
wait 300
said SLEEP TIMER OFF
# SELECT turns the pages: System
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said System page: Tune 0, Lights On
spin K1 3
wait 300
said Tune +3
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
spin K2 -1
wait 300
# the effects (0.8.7: SEL is the Acts page; SELECT on to Effects)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 5
wait 300
said Effects page: Reverb 50, Echo 40, Echo time 1/2., Surf 0
spin K3 -1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/2
# HOME: the story, the acts on the keys
tap HOME
wait 300
said ACTS ON THE KEYS
# HOME + SELECT: the fade (0.8)
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 200
release HOME
wait 300
said FADE
# the keys, in ACTS: a black key mutes its track and back
tapkey b0
said MUTE PAD
tapkey b0
said UNMUTE PAD
# the encoders: Energy, the act
turn ALGO 1
said ENERGY 51
turn ALGO -1
said ENERGY 50
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
said ACT Warm Up
unsaid Level
turn PRESET -1
wait 300
said ACT Doors
# the buttons' messages, said once
tap REC
said FREEZE ON
wait 500
tap REC
said FREEZE OFF
tap PLAY
said RESTING
wait 300
unsaid GROWING
tap PLAY
said GROWING
wait 300
unsaid RESTING
tap OCT+
said ANSWER SHORT ANSWER
tap OCT-
said ANSWER OFF
press EDIT
wait 700
release EDIT
said NEXT CHORD ON THE BAR
# a help card: its button, then its lines
press SAVE
wait 1000
said SAVE button. SAVES EVERY ACT. KEEP HOLDING: THE ACT BACK TO ITS RECIPE
release SAVE
tap SAVE
said SAVED
press REC
wait 1000
said REC button. FREEZE: THE CHORD HOLDS AND THE REVERB RINGS ON. AGAIN: THAW
release REC
wait 100
# a MIDI clock arriving, and start / stop from it
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
wait 20
said Tempo EXT
midi FC 00 00
wait 300
said RESTING
wait 1000
said Tempo 86
# WHERE: everything again
where
said Story page: Tempo 86, Structure 70, Tension 0, Wander 1:29. Piece Pre-show
